[M31_PA_Coil X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Coil"
LocLongDescription="The <Ability:ClassName> coils its body tightly, increasing its defense by <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_DefenseBonus> and dodge by <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_DodgeBonus>, and gaining an extra action on the next turn. The first non-movement action you take on the next turn will not be turn-ending. Allows the use of <font color='#0bff9b'>Defensive Coil</font>."
LocHelpText="Increase defense by <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_DefenseBonus> and dodge by <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_DodgeBonus>, and gain an extra action on the next turn. The first non-movement action you take on the next turn will not be turn-ending."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Can be used without cover.<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown.<br><Bullet> Defensive bonuses are reduced to <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_NoCoverModifier> against flanking and melee attacks or when the <Ability:ClassName> cannot be flanked.<br><Bullet> Certain abilities, like <font color='#0bff9b'>Pinpoint</font> and <font color='#0bff9b'>Defensive Coil</font>, will still end the turn.<br><Bullet> <font color='#0bff9b'>Defensive Coil</font> gives the same defensive bonuses, has no cooldown, and can be used while on fire or disoriented.<br><Bullet> <font color='#0bff9b'>Defensive Coil</font> can be activated by <font color='#0bff9b'>Deep Cover</font>: <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_Hunker_bAllowDeepCover>."
LocFlyOverText="Coil"

[M31_PA_Coil_Hunker X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Defensive Coil"
LocLongDescription="The <Ability:ClassName> coils its body tightly, increasing its defense by <Ability:M31_HunkerDown_DefenseBonus> and dodge by <Ability:M31_HunkerDown_DodgeBonus>."
LocHelpText="Increase defense by <Ability:M31_HunkerDown_DefenseBonus> and dodge by <Ability:M31_HunkerDown_DodgeBonus>."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Can be used without cover.<br><Bullet> Defensive bonuses are reduced to <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_NoCoverModifier> against flanking and melee attacks or when the <Ability:ClassName> cannot be flanked."
LocFlyOverText="Defensive Coil"

[M31_PA_Entwine X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Entwine"
LocLongDescription="Increases Tongue Grab's aim by <Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_AimBonus> and bind damage by <Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_BindDamageBonus>. Additionaly, gain +<Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_DefenseBonus> defense while binding an enemy."
LocHelpText="Increases Tongue Grab's aim by <Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_AimBonus> and bind damage by <Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_BindDamageBonus>. Additionaly, gain +<Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_DefenseBonus> defense while binding an enemy."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Defense and damage bonuses apply to all types of Bind."
LocFlyOverText="Entwine"

[M31_PA_Lockjaw X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Lockjaw"
LocLongDescription="Free bite attack against any enemies that enter, exit or attack from melee range during the enemy turn. Poisons and <font color='#ffd700'>stuns the target for one action</font>. Cannot target robots."
LocHelpText="Free bite attack against any enemies that enter, exit or attack from melee range during the enemy turn. Poisons and <font color='#ffd700'>stuns the target for one action</font>. Has a <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_Cooldown> turn cooldown, but only when the attack successfuly hits. Cannot target robots."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> If an enemy begins their turn in an adjacent tile, Lockjaw will activate if that enemy tries to attack.<br><Bullet> If an enemy does not begin their turn in an adjacent tile, Lockjaw will activate when that enemy moves into melee range.<br><Bullet> Deals <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_Damage> damage, poisons the target, and <font color='#ffd700'>stuns the target for one action, interrupting their turn</font>.<br><Bullet> Counts as reaction fire and cannot crit.<br><Bullet> Only a successful (graze or hit) Lockjaw attack will put the ability on cooldown.<br><Bullet> Only one attempt can made against each target per turn.<br><Bullet> Lockjaw does not activate during the soldier's own turn.<br><Bullet> The poison is the same as Poison Spit's and is affected by <font color='#0bff9b'>Enhanced Poison</font>.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots."
LocFlyOverText="Lockjaw"

[M31_PA_Lockjaw_Attack X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Lockjaw"
LocFlyOverText="Lockjaw"

