LocHelpText="Free bite attack against any enemies that enter, exit or attack from melee range during the enemy turn."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> If an enemy begins their turn in an adjacent tile, Angry Bite will activate if that enemy tries to attack.<br><Bullet> If an enemy does not begin their turn in an adjacent tile, Angry Bite will activate when that enemy moves into melee range.<br><Bullet> Deals <Ability:M31_PA_AngryBite_Damage> damage.<br><Bullet> Has innate +<Ability:M31_PA_AngryBite_AimBonus> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_AngryBite_CritBonus> critical chance.<br><Bullet> Counts as reaction fire.<br><Bullet> Can crit (if reaction fire is allowed to crit): <Ability:M31_PA_AngryBite_bAllowCrit>.<br><Bullet> Has a cooldown (<Ability:M31_PA_AngryBite_Cooldown> turn(s)): <Ability:M31_PA_AngryBite_bHasCooldown>.<br><Bullet> Cooldown applies only on hit: <Ability:M31_PA_AngryBite_bCooldownOnlyOnHit>.<br><Bullet> Angry Bite does not activate during the soldier's own turn.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots."
