[M31_PA_ViperBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Vicious Bite"
LocLongDescription="Bite any enemy within blue movement range. Deals damage, inflicts poison, and ruptures the target. Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown. Cannot target robots and environmental objects."
LocHelpText="Bite any enemy within blue movement range. Deals damage, inflicts poison, and ruptures the target. Cannot target robots."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Deals <Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_Damage> points of damage and <Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_Rupture> points of Rupture. Can crit for +<Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_CritDamage> damage.<br><Bullet> Vicious Bite has innate +<Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_AimBonus> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_CritBonus> critical chance.<br><Bullet> The poison is the same as Poison Spit's and is affected by <font color='#0bff9b'>Enhanced Poison</font>.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots and environmental objects."
LocFlyOverText="Vicious Bite"

[M31_PA_IronskinBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Ironskin Bite"
LocLongDescription="Not-so-gently bite an adjacent ally, giving them <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_ShieldAmount> points of ablative HP for <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_Duration> turn(s). Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown. Cannot target robots."
LocHelpText="Bite an adjacent ally, giving them <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_ShieldAmount> points of ablative HP for <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_Duration> turn(s)."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Shield priority: <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_ShieldPriority>.<br><Bullet> Shields with higher priority will be depleted first."
LocFlyOverText="Ironskin Bite"

[M31_PA_RegenBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Regenerating Bite"
LocLongDescription="Not-so-gently bite an adjacent ally. Applies regeneration, healing <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_HealPerTurn> HP per turn for <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_Duration> turn(s). Has <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission."
LocHelpText="Not-so-gently bite an adjacent ally. Applies regeneration, healing <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_HealPerTurn> HP per turn for <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_Duration> turn(s)."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown and <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission.<br><Bullet> If <font color='#0bff9b'>Enhanced Poison</font> is learned, regeneration will heal <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_EnhHealPerTurn> HP per turn for <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_EnhDuration> turn(s).<br><Bullet> Can be used to stabilize bleeding out soldiers: <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_bStabilize>.<br><Bullet> Cures poison: <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_bRemovePoison>. Provides poison immunity for the duration: <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_bProvidesPoisonImmunity>.<br><Bullet> Can target Vipers: <Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_bCanTargetVipers>.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots."
LocFlyOverText="Regenerating Bite"

[M31_PA_MemeBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="\"Acid\" Bite"
LocLongDescription="Viciously bite an adjacent unit, inflicting \"acid\". Can be used against allies and enemies alike. Has <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission."
LocHelpText="Not-so-gently bite and adjacent unit, inflicting \"acid\". Can be used against allies and enemies alike."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Allied units gain massive stat bonuses to aim, crit chance, dodge, mobility and will, as well as immunity to some mental status effects for <Ability:M31_PA_MemeBite_E> turn(s), but will take a small amount of damage whenever the effect ticks. Watch out for the side effects!<br><Bullet> Hostile units take damage and suffer a variety of extremely potent status effects.<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown and <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots.<br><br><font color='#909497'>\"Are you sure this is the right acid?\"</font>"
LocFlyOverText="\"Acid\" Bite"

