LocLongDescription="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, causing it to blind the target for the same duration. Blinded untis have reduced sight range."
LocHelpText="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, causing it to blind the target for the same duration. Blinded untis have reduced sight range."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> The poison blinds the targets for <Ability:M31_PA_Poison_Duration> turn(s).<br><Bullet> Enhanced poison blinds the targets for <Ability:M31_PA_EnhancedPoison_Duration> turn(s)."
LocFlyOverText="Blinding Poison"

[M31_PA_NeuroPoison X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Neurotoxin"
LocLongDescription="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, causing it to disorient the targets on initial application. Reduces the cooldown of <font color='#0bff9b'>Poison Spit</font> by <Ability:M31_PA_NeuroPoison_CooldownReduction> turn(s)."
LocHelpText="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, causing it to disorient the targets on initial application. Reduces the cooldown of <font color='#0bff9b'>Poison Spit</font> by <Ability:M31_PA_NeuroPoison_CooldownReduction> turn(s)."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Enhanced poison does not affect the duration of this effect.<br><Bullet> Does not disorient enemies immune to poison."
